i3-autodisplay (0.6-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Trim the build path out of the binary.
  * Build reproducibly: identical bytes across build path, hostname, locale,
    timezone, umask, CPU count and file ordering.
  * Publish this version's source package and build record at
    buildinfos.pkg.haus, so anyone can reproduce the build and check it.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Wed, 02 Sep 2026 11:38:12 +0200

i3-autodisplay (0.6-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Migrate to the pkghaus build pipeline
  * x11-xserver-utils is a runtime dependency (xrandr), not a build one
  * Build with the suite's Go against the vendored dependencies; the
    dh-golang machinery is no longer needed
  * Priority optional; extra is deprecated
  * Build for any architecture

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 10:20:32 +0200

